WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.596 --> 00:00:15.121
"I have get to Sunshine Coffee Shop," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:15.141 --> 00:00:17.502
"Zombies are hurting people!"

3
00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:20.924
Roxy went back to the table.

4
00:00:20.944 --> 00:00:22.725
"I just remembered.

5
00:00:23.945 --> 00:00:26.506
I, uh, need to help Principal Penn!"

6
00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.088
Roxy ran down the hall.

7
00:00:33.088 --> 00:00:35.169
She threw open the door and leaped into the sky.

8
00:00:43.132 --> 00:00:45.113
People stood outside Sunshine Coffee Shop.

9
00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:49.455
When Roxy got closer, she saw they were not normal people.

10
00:00:51.116 --> 00:00:52.196
Their eyes were blank.

11
00:00:53.016 --> 00:00:54.057
Their hair was messy.

12
00:00:54.957 --> 00:00:56.338
And they moved in a strange way.

13
00:00:56.358 --> 00:01:00.920
"Zombies!" Roxy said.

14
00:01:02.172 --> 00:01:04.393
A woman was in the doorway of Sunshine Coffee Shop.

15
00:01:05.194 --> 00:01:07.055
She was waving zombies away with a broom.

16
00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:10.036
The zombies' mouths snapped open and shut.

17
00:01:10.056 --> 00:01:13.678
"Get out of here!"

18
00:01:14.099 --> 00:01:14.859
the woman yelled.

19
00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.622
Roxy swooped down and pushed the zombies away from the door.

20
00:01:21.343 --> 00:01:22.483
Then she ran in with the woman.

21
00:01:24.664 --> 00:01:26.205
The woman locked the door behind her.

22
00:01:26.225 --> 00:01:30.908
"Whew!" The woman ran a hand across her forehead.

23
00:01:31.804 --> 00:01:32.965
"That was scary!

24
00:01:33.886 --> 00:01:35.847
I'm glad you're here, Rocket Girl."

25
00:01:35.867 --> 00:01:38.609
"No problem," Roxy said.

26
00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.251
Suddenly she spotted Detective Smith.

27
00:01:41.891 --> 00:01:44.313
He stood up near a case with only a few donuts left.

28
00:01:45.414 --> 00:01:46.335
His hair was messy.

29
00:01:46.355 --> 00:01:49.457
"Ahh!" Roxy cried.

30
00:01:49.477 --> 00:01:51.678
"It's another zombie!"

31
00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.440
Detective Smith frowned.

32
00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.042
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

33
00:01:57.843 --> 00:01:59.084
He tried to pat down his hair.

34
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.062
"I forgot to brush my hair this morning."

35
00:02:04.103 --> 00:02:05.364
Roxy pointed out the window.

36
00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:08.467
"What turned all those people into zombies?"

37
00:02:09.568 --> 00:02:11.049
Detective Smith scratched his head.

38
00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:12.950
His hair got messier.

39
00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:14.932
"I'm not sure."

40
00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:17.434
The woman pointed at the case.

41
00:02:17.454 --> 00:02:19.536
"It was those donuts."

42
00:02:20.556 --> 00:02:21.177
"How do you know?"

43
00:02:21.597 --> 00:02:22.258
Roxy asked.

44
00:02:22.278 --> 00:02:25.721
"A man came in earlier," she said.

45
00:02:25.741 --> 00:02:29.584
"After he ate one of the donuts, he looked strange.

46
00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:34.077
He tried to bite another customer, so I pushed him outside.

47
00:02:36.098 --> 00:02:38.159
Other people ate the donuts after that.

48
00:02:38.859 --> 00:02:41.300
The same thing happened to them."

49
00:02:42.941 --> 00:02:44.401
Detective Smith opened the case.

50
00:02:45.182 --> 00:02:46.762
He picked up a donut and studied it.

51
00:02:46.782 --> 00:02:49.744
"It looks like a regular donut to me."

52
00:02:49.764 --> 00:02:52.445
"Did this ever happen before?"

53
00:02:52.825 --> 00:02:53.485
Roxy asked.

54
00:02:54.526 --> 00:02:55.526
The woman shook her head.

55
00:02:55.546 --> 00:03:00.488
"Never. I just started ordering these donuts from a new bakery.

56
00:03:01.504 --> 00:03:03.225
These are the first ones I got."

57
00:03:04.345 --> 00:03:05.645
"What's the name of the bakery?"

58
00:03:05.965 --> 00:03:06.986
Detective Smith asked.

59
00:03:07.006 --> 00:03:09.747
"Le Sweet's," the woman said.

60
00:03:09.767 --> 00:03:13.328
"It's just outside the city, near the mountains."

61
00:03:14.508 --> 00:03:16.669
"I'll go and check it out," Roxy said.

62
00:03:18.569 --> 00:03:19.910
She ran out the door and flew off.

63
00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.471
Down the block she saw the door to Shop well Supermarket fly open.

64
00:03:25.391 --> 00:03:27.792
A huge pack of zombies spilled out from the door!
